{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03341","headline":"奉和荐福寺应制 · 宋之问","name":"奉和荐福寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵筵光圣邸，游豫览宏规。\n不改灵光殿，因开功德池。\n莲生新步叶，桂长昔攀枝。\n涌塔庭中见，飞楼海上移。\n闻韶三月幸，观象七星危。\n欲识龙归处，朝朝云气随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}